OL,3,ADonald Trump's biggest economic problem
OL,4,Alooks strangely familiar
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe White House is confronting a
OL,7,Ffamiliar dilemma. The economic numbers
OL,8,Faren't necessarily bad - but the public
OL,9,Fmood is.
OL,11,FIt's a disconnect that haunted Joe
OL,12,FBiden in 2024, when solid headline data
OL,13,Ffailed to convince many voters that the
OL,14,Feconomy was working for them.
OL,16,FNow, Donald Trump faces a version of
OL,17,Fthe same challenge.
OL,19,FDuring the 2024 campaign, Trump
OL,20,Fpromised voters swift relief from
OL,21,Frising prices.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
